{"5122080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Merge Command","steam_appid":5122080,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[5316260],"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge<\/strong> matching rockets in battles to gain an advantage<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch<\/strong> rockets to destroy opposing silos, create breaches and deal direct damage<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn<\/strong> resources through successful attacks to unlock your potential<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade<\/strong> silos for free in 1v1 PvP battles or with resources between matches<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research<\/strong> faster reloads, rockets and commands to increase your overall strength<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Program<\/strong> a battle algorithm to automate some or all of your actions<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank Up<\/strong> through PvE qualifications to officially prove your status among rivals<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5122080\/extras\/b915db115147151c554c0f1ee4ef005f.poster.avif?t=1793666602\" aria-label=\"Rockets merging ech other from left and then launch happens\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5122080\/extras\/b915db115147151c554c0f1ee4ef005f.webm?t=1793666602\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5122080\/extras\/b915db115147151c554c0f1ee4ef005f.mp4?t=1793666602\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For PC